LICH-003 Seed Corpus: CRC-16 Collision Hunting

Seeds target CRC-16/CCITT-FALSE collision hunting.
The birthday bound for 16-bit CRC is ~256 inputs (50% chance of collision).

Known collision pairs found during fuzzing should be saved here as:
  collision_NNN_a.bin / collision_NNN_b.bin

Monad header seeds (18 bytes each) for monad-specific collision hunting
are embedded in the harness.
